# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artifacts (regenerable via the build_*.bat scripts)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.exe
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.lib
*.exp
*.res
*.nativecodeanalysis.xml
*.nativecodeanalysis.xml.filter

# Profile-guided optimization profiles
*.pgc
*.pgd
*.pgt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Benchmark scratch output
#
# The probe scripts write `.mph_*.stdout.tmp` / `.mph_*.stderr.tmp` into the
# repository root. Those captures are collected into `audit_logs/` (see
# audit_logs/README.md) rather than being deleted, so the audit trail survives.
# Neither the raw captures nor the collected copy is versioned — both are
# regenerable output.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.mph_*.tmp
*.tmp
audit_logs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Superseded first-generation implementations (kept on disk, not versioned)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
old/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent workspace (project memory and session state)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.workbuddy-ai/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
